    "Per child:256MiB AS,30/31s CPU,zero core/file-size limits,45s wall watchdog, bounded/truncation-marked output, exit/signal/errno and wait4 resource report. SIGCHLD disposition reset before own-child supervision; timeout kills/reaps only the owned child.",
    "One bounded read-only unauthenticated JSON server on TCP48999 after cases, five-minute serve window and ten-minute overall alarm. No input/control verbs.",
    "512KiB compressed/1MiB expanded package caps; fixed name/file list/modes/empty setup/end and ELF architecture checks. Uploader validates the same bounded byte snapshot it sends. Fixed ordinary upload/status/uninstall client; no SSH/root access needed."
